which I'm so excited.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.445
-Yes. This is me and my mom

00:05:46.445 --> 00:05:47.947
singing "Baby
It's Cold Outside."

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:49.581
-Check it out.

00:05:49.581 --> 00:05:51.050
-I'm reading
for the role of Eric.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.853
My mom, Seema, is going to be
reading the role of Georgia.

00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:55.487
-♪ I really can't stay ♪

00:05:55.487 --> 00:05:57.557
-♪ Baby, it's cold outside ♪

00:05:57.557 --> 00:05:59.391
-♪ I've got to go away ♪

00:05:59.391 --> 00:06:01.493
-♪ But I can call you a ride ♪

00:06:01.493 --> 00:06:03.996
♪ I'm so glad you dropped in ♪

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:06.631
-♪ So very nice ♪

00:06:06.631 --> 00:06:08.934
-[ Laughs ] That's sweet.

00:06:08.934 --> 00:06:10.035
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:10.035 --> 00:06:11.704
-Yeah!
-Dude, that is sweet.

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:13.205
-Come on!
-That's cute.

00:06:13.205 --> 00:06:16.408
-And, Mom, thank you
for helping me get that role.

00:06:16.408 --> 00:06:17.643
She had no idea. She goes,

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:20.045
"Why won't this man
let this woman leave?"

00:06:20.045 --> 00:06:22.682
I go, "People have been talking
about this for a long time.

00:06:22.682 --> 00:06:24.250
It is a problem."
-It's a problem, yeah.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.884
But this is --

00:06:25.884 --> 00:06:28.120
It's a giant role for you.
And I love --

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.622
You know I'm a fan,
so congratulations on this.

00:06:30.622 --> 00:06:32.158
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:06:32.158 --> 00:06:34.560
Here's Hasan Minhaj
in "The Morning Show."

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.794
Take a look at this.

00:06:35.794 --> 00:06:37.230
-Hey, I've got a little
something here,

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.031
and I want to make a toast.

00:06:39.031 --> 00:06:40.099
-Okay.

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:41.634
-To you.
-Uh-oh.

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:43.636
-Because you came in
at a really difficult time,

00:06:43.636 --> 00:06:46.272
and you just really
pulled me through it.

00:06:46.272 --> 00:06:49.408
You've been sincerely
an amazing partner,

00:06:49.408 --> 00:06:52.178
and I just want to thank you.

00:06:54.547 --> 00:06:56.749
-That means a lot. Honestly.

00:06:56.749 --> 00:06:59.318
And you've been
a great partner, too.

00:06:59.318 --> 00:07:01.454
-Well, here's to
the year ahead for us.

00:07:01.454 --> 00:07:02.721
-Alright.

00:07:02.721 --> 00:07:04.423
