00:07:04.423 --> 00:07:06.893
I got to?
-Yeah, go, go, go.

00:07:06.893 --> 00:07:09.395
Quick.

00:07:09.395 --> 00:07:11.830
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Hasan Minhaj!

